っていれば衣装、細かなデザインのアレンジOKです！\n\n＜参考資料＞\n■受け（ねずみ）元キャラ資料\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1cf9znnEy6bGgEGy6P7SJp1fzh6rbc10G/view?usp=sharing\n\n■攻め（猫）元キャラ資料\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1SveO7x3pmssdWt8K3RaNscch7syDrfs5/view?usp=sharing\n\n■擬獣化イメージ参考\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1PzFvHpROqp2-OOq_2w93o0E7d-U7JkhK/view?usp=sharing\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1-1BXCHK3-y1xhPqU4lttkWMkfjnfjeYD/view?usp=sharing\nhttps://083.trpger.us/house/shell01/c9f4d00e-3601-46e4-9ec6-94272e5f97ac.png\n\nぜひご検討いただきますと幸いです！どうぞよろしくお願いいたします。", "nc": 16, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@tuneyama23/works/6", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 387256, "client_id": 3052396, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/1f20c99c/uploads/origins/8e80db9b-c36e-4450-8cc7-779b0131c086?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b5cc669a16e6cbddcf957d62484e6514", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/1f20c99c/uploads/origins/8e80db9b-c36e-4450-8cc7-779b0131c086?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b5cc669a16e6cbddcf957d62484e6514, https://si.imgix.net/1f20c99c/uploads/origins/8e80db9b-c36e-4450-8cc7-779b0131c086?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=df72005e988e9ef2994ce1ffac8d2371 2x, https://si.imgix.net/1f20c99c/uploads/origins/8e80db9b-c36e-4450-8cc7-779b0131c086?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=be6d931c65c2f17c2b8229813f04ba8c 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/1f20c99c/uploads/origins/8e80db9b-c36e-4450-8cc7-779b0131c086?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=63ae7d4e8a95c3025ed89e711468148d", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/1f20c99c/uploads/origins/8e80db9b-c36e-44